WEBVTT

00:00:22.281 --> 00:00:26.547
Sasha. I can't hold back anymore.
So, it's okay, right?

00:00:27.586 --> 00:00:30.248
This is wrong! Mafuyu!

00:00:33.325 --> 00:00:34.883
"Wrong"? What is?

00:00:36.261 --> 00:00:37.660
Good morning.

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:40.332
Please wake up, Master.

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:41.867
Who're you?

00:00:41.867 --> 00:00:44.203
Come, now. I'm Edgar.

00:00:44.203 --> 00:00:47.673
I became indebted to you at
Miss Miyuri Tsujidou's mansion.

00:00:47.673 --> 00:00:48.605
Indebted?

00:00:48.874 --> 00:00:51.570
Yes. Please allow me to serve you.

00:00:52.611 --> 00:00:53.839
What are you saying?!

00:00:55.848 --> 00:00:58.180
For you to come voluntarily enter my bed...

00:00:59.151 --> 00:01:00.584
You're the first drink of the morning!

00:01:07.826 --> 00:01:09.161
You're a man?!

00:01:09.161 --> 00:01:12.096
Did I ever once say I was a girl?

00:01:17.136 --> 00:01:18.626
Tremble!

00:01:21.573 --> 00:01:24.633
I will NOT forgive this! I'll kill you!

00:01:26.245 --> 00:01:28.440
What's all this early-morning racket?!

00:01:34.319 --> 00:01:44.863
Trance, nureta tsumi ga yobu shoudou

00:01:44.863 --> 00:01:49.027
Modokashii aserasareta kodou

00:01:50.035 --> 00:01:53.835
Kimi wa aizu mo mushi datta

00:01:55.240 --> 00:02:00.041
Dandan to ronri ga kuruu to shittete

00:02:00.446 --> 00:02:04.849
Nerau inochi ga moeru

00:02:05.384 --> 00:02:10.556
Isshu no kairaku, itai yo, mune

00:02:10.556 --> 00:02:14.860
Afuresou na seihai

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:21.366
Shizumare, suberu made wa osaete

00:02:21.366 --> 00:02:28.307
Subete te ni iretai to kimeta, Lilith yo

00:02:28.307 --> 00:02:30.776
Harisakesou, imademo

00:02:30.776 --> 00:02:34.413
Watashi o dakishimete

00:02:34.413 --> 00:02:38.717
Kurushimeru imi o misete

00:02:38.717 --> 00:02:44.623
Owarasero, saigo wa kokoro no kakera sae

00:02:44.623 --> 00:02:49.828
Kimi ga motomeru kyouchi ni wa todokisou ni nai

00:02:49.828 --> 00:02:52.431
I, I, I

00:02:52.431 --> 00:02:55.594
I'm in spiral

00:02:56.001 --> 00:02:58.799
Qwaser of Stigmata II

00:03:00.606 --> 00:03:00.939
Peace Ends, and the Cogs of Destiny Begin to Turn

00:03:00.939 --> 00:03:03.275
This is the place you were after.

00:03:03.275 --> 00:03:03.642
Peace Ends, and the Cogs of Destiny Begin to Turn

00:03:03.642 --> 00:03:05.477
The Shrine of Water, which leads to

00:03:05.477 --> 00:03:07.312
the Theotokos of Tsarytsin...

00:03:07.312 --> 00:03:10.983
The party's over.
It no longer has any meaning.

00:03:10.983 --> 00:03:14.111
Friedrich Tanner lies here now, yes?

00:03:15.821 --> 00:03:18.221
Tanner was my first master.

00:03:19.091 --> 00:03:22.925
That uncommon terrorist,
the Two-Headed Crest Maker...

00:03:23.695 --> 00:03:25.492
What connection do you have to him?

00:03:26.932 --> 00:03:28.957
I belonged to him.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.675
I'm a vessel.

00:03:36.675 --> 00:03:41.942
The circuits he collected were carved
into my body. I'm a living canvas.

00:03:43.148 --> 00:03:49.388
The most powerful of High Ancient Circuits,
the Noah of Gold, lives within me.

00:03:49.388 --> 00:03:51.288
I await the day it becomes active.

00:03:52.291 --> 00:03:56.318
Thanks to your killing Tanner, I became free.

00:04:01.166 --> 00:04:07.239
But coming out into the open,
now everyone is out to kill you, huh?

00:04:07.239 --> 00:04:10.876
Tanner had a ton of world-class
perverts at his side.

00:04:10.876 --> 00:04:14.213
When I heard your story, it hit me.

00:04:14.213 --> 00:04:15.874
You're like me!

00:04:19.051 --> 00:04:22.854
I thought that maybe you would aid me.

00:04:22.854 --> 00:04:25.023
So you came to St. Mihailov...

00:04:25.023 --> 00:04:28.160
Playing the idiot while setting
your sights on me?

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:31.561
Yup. I've watched you this whole time,
and you passed!

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:34.626
You can become my master!

00:04:35.334 --> 00:04:36.995
Quit screwing with me already!

00:04:39.771 --> 00:04:40.703
I'm sorry.

00:04:41.506 --> 00:04:44.168
What do you know about me?

00:04:45.444 --> 00:04:48.880
You don't understand a single other person.

00:04:49.248 --> 00:04:51.716
Why would I help you?

00:04:52.017 --> 00:04:54.247
You're telling me I should just die?

00:04:54.953 --> 00:04:56.511
Depends on the circumstances.

00:04:59.424 --> 00:05:04.088
If you don't want to die, cut the crap and
tell me what you REALLY want...

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:07.562
The desire that's in your heart.

00:05:14.539 --> 00:05:18.143
Say it, Edgar. What do you want?

00:05:18.143 --> 00:05:22.881
I want to live. To be with the others.

00:05:22.881 --> 00:05:26.180
I can't stand being alone anymore!

00:05:43.769 --> 00:05:45.804
The Noah of Gold...

00:05:45.804 --> 00:05:48.364
To think we would meet at a place like this.

00:05:52.778 --> 00:05:54.279
That damn Yuri.

00:05:54.279 --> 00:05:56.645
He knew this but kept me on standby, huh?

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.282
Now then...

00:06:04.156 --> 00:06:11.363
Father Yuri. You didn't tell us that you knew the
location of the Noah of Gold, did you?

00:06:11.363 --> 00:06:13.365
Don't act surprised.

00:06:13.365 --> 00:06:16.732
You knew even without my having to tell you

00:06:18.337 --> 00:06:22.841
This is true, but an organization needs rules.

00:06:22.841 --> 00:06:26.178
And which of us now threatens those rules?

00:06:26.178 --> 00:06:29.948
Athos cannot save the world in
its current, lax state.

00:06:29.948 --> 00:06:34.519
Why not change how things are done,
relying instead upon Meteora?

00:06:34.519 --> 00:06:36.282
Such is my proposal.

00:06:36.955 --> 00:06:42.160
Athos serves but one God, and yet we quarrel.

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:46.865
Yes, we humans are truly pitiful, sinful creatures

00:06:46.865 --> 00:06:50.736
Then you are determined to oppose us, are you?

00:06:50.736 --> 00:06:55.707
Yes. I cannot hand over the Noah
to people as dangerous as you.

00:06:55.707 --> 00:06:57.675
Please, fall back.

00:07:03.248 --> 00:07:06.877
Our boring "recess" is ended!

00:07:07.986 --> 00:07:12.224
I'm sorry, Nami.
Having you help me on a Sunday...

00:07:12.224 --> 00:07:16.862
No, it's fine.
I like working with you, Miss President.

00:07:16.862 --> 00:07:19.498
You're a smooth talker.

00:07:19.498 --> 00:07:21.333
Let's get some tea on the way home.

00:07:21.333 --> 00:07:22.561
Yes!

00:07:24.669 --> 00:07:29.241
It's Miyuri Tsujidou doing whatever she
wants that causes problems...

00:07:29.241 --> 00:07:32.344
That's what makes all this work for us, right?

00:07:32.344 --> 00:07:33.845
Um, Ma'am...

00:07:33.845 --> 00:07:34.504
Huh?

00:07:36.848 --> 00:07:39.017
Ma'am, please listen.

00:07:39.017 --> 00:07:40.786
What is it?

00:07:40.786 --> 00:07:44.356
I liked school life at this academy.

00:07:44.356 --> 00:07:47.985
Working for the student council was fun,
like it was a game.

00:07:48.627 --> 00:07:52.358
More than anything, I liked YOU.

00:07:53.265 --> 00:07:54.254
Nami...

00:07:54.699 --> 00:07:59.159
I thought, "I hope these boring days
can continue forever."

00:08:00.071 --> 00:08:04.531
If my orders hadn't come,
I could've just stayed here.

00:08:08.113 --> 00:08:09.481
It's a shame.

00:08:09.481 --> 00:08:10.615
Ow!

00:08:10.615 --> 00:08:11.775
She's so strong!

00:08:16.354 --> 00:08:17.556
Nami!

00:08:17.556 --> 00:08:20.855
Why? What's happened?

00:08:21.493 --> 00:08:23.859
Who are you?

00:08:24.629 --> 00:08:30.363
I'm Nami Okiura... Of Athos's Divine Punishment
Enforcement Unit, Meteora.

00:08:32.437 --> 00:08:36.100
Say goodbye to the fake everyday life
you've known thus far.

00:08:36.741 --> 00:08:40.178
As of now, my orders to stand by are rescinded.

00:08:40.178 --> 00:08:41.805
The punishment begins.

00:08:55.927 --> 00:08:58.623
And now, you are my puppet.

00:09:01.333 --> 00:09:04.097
I love you, Yumie.

00:09:07.339 --> 00:09:09.474
Sasha sure is late, huh?

00:09:09.474 --> 00:09:12.811
How many hours will this "important talk" take?

00:09:12.811 --> 00:09:16.448
Maybe things went well and they're
out having fun somewhere.

00:09:16.448 --> 00:09:17.938
I hope that's the case...

00:09:19.885 --> 00:09:20.852
Sasha?

00:09:20.852 --> 00:09:21.419
Hm?

00:09:21.419 --> 00:09:22.153
Yumie Hiiragi

00:09:22.153 --> 00:09:23.889
The student council president!

00:09:23.889 --> 00:09:25.117
Yumie Hiiragi

00:09:27.292 --> 00:09:28.727
Oribe.

00:09:28.727 --> 00:09:31.463
What is this "sudden advice" you need?

00:09:31.463 --> 00:09:33.795
Can you listen and stay calm?

00:09:34.499 --> 00:09:35.500
Yes...

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.196
I like Sasha.

00:09:41.606 --> 00:09:44.976
W-Well, he is popular.

00:09:44.976 --> 00:09:47.345
I'll be blunt. Oribe!

00:09:47.345 --> 00:09:49.108
Please break up with Sasha!

00:09:49.915 --> 00:09:50.882
Huh?

00:09:52.584 --> 00:09:57.255
Oribe, I don't think YOU are enough
to give Sasha fulfillment!

00:09:57.255 --> 00:10:00.959
M-Miss Hiiragi! Why would you
suddenly say that?

00:10:00.959 --> 00:10:05.664
It's not "sudden" at all.
I've watched Sasha this whole time.

00:10:05.664 --> 00:10:07.432
I can suffer this no longer!

00:10:07.432 --> 00:10:08.600
Come on!

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.301
Look.

00:10:09.301 --> 00:10:09.967
Huh?!

00:10:12.537 --> 00:10:15.206
I am confident in my breasts.

00:10:15.206 --> 00:10:18.334
I'm sure I can fulfill Sasha more than you!

00:10:18.877 --> 00:10:20.378
Just calm down.

00:10:20.378 --> 00:10:24.041
I understand what you're saying,
but you've got some things wrong.

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:28.046
These are the breasts that seduced Sasha, eh?

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.887
Oh, my. Things are already
heating up, aren't they?

00:10:32.757 --> 00:10:37.796
Yumie, you're way too forceful.
A side effect of the vampire virus, maybe?

00:10:37.796 --> 00:10:39.531
Miss Vice President!

00:10:39.531 --> 00:10:40.865
Why are you nude?

00:10:40.865 --> 00:10:42.968
Thank you for coming.

00:10:42.968 --> 00:10:45.869
I would like you to join our ranks.

00:10:46.404 --> 00:10:47.872
What are you?

00:10:47.872 --> 00:10:50.976
I am of Meteora and one of the Pentarchy...

00:10:50.976 --> 00:10:52.500
"Brassiere" Nami!

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:56.381
It's no good.

00:10:56.381 --> 00:10:59.248
I've strengthened Yumie just the way I like it.

00:11:13.498 --> 00:11:15.400
Mafuyu Oribe...

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.528
You will kill the Deadly One, Sasha.

00:11:19.804 --> 00:11:22.170
Yes, Master.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:28.013
Mafuyu! We were so worried.

00:11:28.013 --> 00:11:29.914
Sorry, Tomo.

00:11:29.914 --> 00:11:32.280
Helping her out took a long time.

00:11:32.951 --> 00:11:34.612
Don't make Tomo anxious.

00:11:35.553 --> 00:11:38.750
She's fine. After all, she's not a child.

00:11:39.324 --> 00:11:42.259
YOU, on the other hand,
leave without any word, right?

00:11:43.662 --> 00:11:44.924
Never mind me.

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:48.600
You're hungry, aren't you?
I'll get dinner ready soon.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:51.228
Ah! I'm starving!

00:12:09.954 --> 00:12:11.285
Kill.

00:12:20.899 --> 00:12:22.033
Sasha!

00:12:22.033 --> 00:12:25.992
Did you think a sedative like that
could put ME to sleep?

00:12:27.505 --> 00:12:30.375
Dying would've been easier if you were asleep.

00:12:30.375 --> 00:12:34.546
You're an Adept Qwaser? Where is Mafuyu?!

00:12:34.546 --> 00:12:36.309
You've got it wrong.

00:12:40.385 --> 00:12:42.754
I am the real Mafuyu Oribe.

00:12:42.754 --> 00:12:43.948
You're being controlled?!

00:12:44.255 --> 00:12:45.517
I've been reborn.

00:12:46.291 --> 00:12:48.054
Through HER power.

00:12:49.928 --> 00:12:50.690
Wait!

00:12:54.199 --> 00:12:55.834
Are you really Mafuyu?

00:12:55.834 --> 00:12:59.771
Yes, I am. That's why you can't kill me.

00:12:59.771 --> 00:13:01.039
Don't mock me.

00:13:01.039 --> 00:13:04.676
I have no need for a Maria
that's being controlled!

00:13:04.676 --> 00:13:07.812
Such bravado. But can you really do it?

00:13:07.812 --> 00:13:08.904
Of course!

00:13:10.281 --> 00:13:12.249
Then try it.

00:13:12.784 --> 00:13:16.151
See if your power will work on
the Maria of the Blade!

00:13:18.289 --> 00:13:19.290
Tremble!

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.986
Pitiful. Fight me for real!

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:28.290
The truth is, you can't kill me, can you?

00:13:28.733 --> 00:13:30.667
It's a problem of pulling your punches.

00:13:31.202 --> 00:13:31.861
Screw you!

00:13:33.638 --> 00:13:36.607
Circuit engaged. Molecular dissolution.

00:13:40.111 --> 00:13:42.247
Such "swordsmanship."

00:13:42.247 --> 00:13:45.383
The Deadly One, Sasha, really can't kill me!

00:13:45.383 --> 00:13:49.513
You can't kill the girl you love!
You really are a softie!

00:13:56.995 --> 00:13:59.964
This is... the power of the Maria of the Blade?

00:14:00.431 --> 00:14:03.127
Wrong. It's your own naivety!

00:14:09.107 --> 00:14:10.842
This feels good.

00:14:10.842 --> 00:14:13.678
I wanted things to come to this sooner.

00:14:13.678 --> 00:14:16.146
Acting all ladylike was SO stupid.

00:14:16.614 --> 00:14:20.518
Heh. You're saying Mafuyu is "ladylike"?

00:14:20.518 --> 00:14:21.644
Yes, she is!

00:14:23.421 --> 00:14:26.788
This is the greatest power I've faced,
out of all my fights!

00:14:34.365 --> 00:14:37.335
Dammit. If I just had soma...

00:14:37.335 --> 00:14:42.272
Too bad. Your Maria now intends to kill you.

00:14:44.475 --> 00:14:45.601
Mafuyu...

00:14:46.044 --> 00:14:47.136
Goodbye.

00:14:47.679 --> 00:14:49.078
I cared so much for you.

00:14:50.381 --> 00:14:51.746
Mafuyu!

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:54.786
Huh. Don't know when to give up, do you?

00:14:54.786 --> 00:14:58.017
Even if you are an Athos warrior,
you'd act so shameful right to the end?

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.656
Jeez! What kind of a weirdo are you?!

00:15:07.799 --> 00:15:09.167
That shock just now...

00:15:09.167 --> 00:15:11.465
We have to hurry up and kill him.

00:15:11.703 --> 00:15:15.673
No, I won't kill him... I'll kill him!

00:15:15.673 --> 00:15:17.140
I'll kill him!

00:15:47.538 --> 00:15:48.630
Mafuyu.

00:15:49.874 --> 00:15:53.708
This is far too shameless,
even for a Maria of Athos.

00:15:54.412 --> 00:15:55.071
Teresa!

00:15:55.546 --> 00:16:00.919
Mafuyu has become infected by the
Nosferatu worm, which Meteora developed.

00:16:00.919 --> 00:16:01.715
Meteora?

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:05.018
Noah has appeared. Meteora has engaged...

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:06.917
The battle shall begin.

00:16:08.393 --> 00:16:09.360
Yeah.

00:16:11.596 --> 00:16:14.394
Deadly One, Sasha.
Your standby orders are rescinded!

00:16:14.933 --> 00:16:15.365
< Yeah! >

00:16:18.002 --> 00:16:19.094
Here goes!

00:16:24.709 --> 00:16:27.337
It's been so long. This feeling...

00:16:28.279 --> 00:16:29.507
Sasha!

00:16:29.981 --> 00:16:32.449
I've missed this. The power...

00:16:32.951 --> 00:16:34.009
It swells!

00:16:35.653 --> 00:16:36.984
Here I come, Mafuyu!

00:16:37.288 --> 00:16:39.017
I'll remove your brainwashing!

00:16:41.125 --> 00:16:43.116
Maria of the Blade!

00:17:06.017 --> 00:17:07.952
The virus that has violated you...

00:17:07.952 --> 00:17:09.544
I'll suck it all out!

00:17:09.854 --> 00:17:11.219
Sasha...

00:17:16.761 --> 00:17:19.286
May the sinner find redemption.

00:17:30.208 --> 00:17:31.470
Sasha.

00:17:32.477 --> 00:17:33.671
You're finally awake?

00:17:34.178 --> 00:17:37.582
Sasha's been making such a fuss!

00:17:37.582 --> 00:17:38.583
It's embarrassing.

00:17:38.583 --> 00:17:39.777
I made no fuss.

00:17:41.019 --> 00:17:42.646
Just what happened?

00:17:43.287 --> 00:17:44.789
You don't remember?

00:17:44.789 --> 00:17:45.823
About what?

00:17:45.823 --> 00:17:48.917
Ingenious. Makes for a difficult enemy.

00:17:50.194 --> 00:17:51.796
Sasha, you're hurt!

00:17:51.796 --> 00:17:53.798
This hardly counts as an injury.

00:17:53.798 --> 00:17:56.000
Could it be that I?

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:56.796
No.

00:18:01.572 --> 00:18:02.539
Mafuyu.

00:18:03.307 --> 00:18:05.002
The war will begin.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:15.114
Huh? Why am I naked?!

00:18:20.024 --> 00:18:27.231
Yuri will not back down.
It seems he truly wishes to die, Leon.

00:18:27.231 --> 00:18:29.529
All things by God's will.

00:18:34.405 --> 00:18:37.670
You want to make me take off this eye patch?

00:18:51.589 --> 00:18:53.758
A titanium Qwaser.

00:18:53.758 --> 00:18:55.026
I made it.

00:18:55.026 --> 00:18:57.795
Lizzy. You've grown stronger.

00:18:57.795 --> 00:18:59.262
Is that due to your training?

00:18:59.597 --> 00:19:01.899
How can you talk so nonchalantly?

00:19:01.899 --> 00:19:04.663
Did you think you could take all
these guys on by yourself?

00:19:05.036 --> 00:19:06.936
Well, at least get a few blows in.

00:19:07.638 --> 00:19:08.773
Dang it!

00:19:08.773 --> 00:19:13.176
How to deal with Noah is currently
under papal discussion.

00:19:13.578 --> 00:19:16.843
You will stand down from all activities
relating to this matter!

00:19:17.248 --> 00:19:20.775
It's far too late for that.
I'll do nothing of the sort!

00:19:20.952 --> 00:19:21.953
Sing!

00:19:21.953 --> 00:19:23.511
Excalibur!

00:19:34.332 --> 00:19:37.961
Hmm... Things have gotten rather troublesome.

00:19:38.603 --> 00:19:39.900
Would you mind telling my fortune?

00:19:40.338 --> 00:19:43.102
I never thought you'd come to Japan.

00:19:43.975 --> 00:19:46.808
I've come to take my sister back with me.

00:19:47.745 --> 00:19:50.515
Impossible for you, I'd say...

00:19:50.515 --> 00:19:53.746
You worthless roentgenium user.

00:19:54.352 --> 00:19:55.717
That's in the past.

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:57.651
My, my.

00:19:58.456 --> 00:20:03.361
The Red Copper Doll User
has made her appearance.

00:20:03.361 --> 00:20:07.058
It's been a while...
Not that I've missed you or anything.

00:20:09.467 --> 00:20:12.163
Well, it seems that you want to die first.

00:20:16.007 --> 00:20:18.168
I'm gonna have some fun with this.

00:20:18.643 --> 00:20:19.302
Mama!

00:20:23.414 --> 00:20:25.041
What is this?!

00:20:25.983 --> 00:20:26.972
Miss Katja!

00:20:28.119 --> 00:20:35.616
Wounded little girl,
my name is Joshua Phrygianos...

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:39.452
AKA, the Eleventh Exile.

00:20:41.499 --> 00:20:45.629
Thus, we've had so many visitors that
the situation is tumultuous.

00:20:46.204 --> 00:20:48.506
The chain of command is in chaos.

00:20:48.506 --> 00:20:50.804
What do you intend to do, Sasha?

00:20:51.409 --> 00:20:53.809
I'll judge that for myself, without orders.

00:20:56.247 --> 00:21:00.274
I will protect those I wish to keep safe
with all my strength, period.

00:21:00.718 --> 00:21:03.888
Well, well. It seems you've learned
to express yourself.

00:21:03.888 --> 00:21:09.155
But it sounds like you want to protect others
based on order of importance.

00:21:10.228 --> 00:21:11.627
I'm only human.

00:21:11.996 --> 00:21:12.792
Yes.

00:21:13.564 --> 00:21:14.861
Sasha...

00:21:15.166 --> 00:21:20.194
If anyone can say that all lives are equal,
it would have to be God.

00:21:20.304 --> 00:21:20.838
LET THE CALM ANNOUNCE THE END

00:21:20.838 --> 00:21:23.674
< Let the calm announce the end. >

00:21:23.674 --> 00:21:24.333
LET THE CALM ANNOUNCE THE END

00:21:24.742 --> 00:21:28.143
Either that, or love no one at all.

00:21:28.412 --> 00:21:29.080
THE COGS OF DESTINY BEGIN TO TURN

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:32.850
< The cogs of destiny begin to turn. >

00:21:45.429 --> 00:21:53.666
If I am not God, I can only live
in accordance with human love!

00:22:13.491 --> 00:22:19.930
Yuraida, hitaishou no kidou

00:22:19.930 --> 00:22:26.437
Jokyoku ni kazashita kousai

00:22:26.437 --> 00:22:32.677
Hikari no shuushisen wa hizunda mama

00:22:32.677 --> 00:22:38.274
Kashika sareta yume o kataru

00:22:40.151 --> 00:22:45.523
Yuuan na kyokou no shin'en ni

00:22:45.523 --> 00:22:51.629
Itsuka torawareta sekai o uchinuke

00:22:51.629 --> 00:22:53.597
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:53.597 --> 00:22:55.266
And you will die in your sin

00:22:55.266 --> 00:22:58.469
Juuji o kire, fuzai no kami ni

00:22:58.469 --> 00:23:02.106
Kakusei no uta o kanadeshi koe wa

00:23:02.106 --> 00:23:04.942
Boutoku no tsurugi ka?

00:23:04.942 --> 00:23:06.510
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:23:06.510 --> 00:23:08.179
Let no one lead you astray

00:23:08.179 --> 00:23:11.949
Shadan sareta kimi to no oratorio

00:23:11.949 --> 00:23:14.819
Aisetsu o tsuki ga terashite

00:23:14.819 --> 00:23:20.416
Aoku kagayaku asu e no eve
